# ==========================================================================
# Data — pipeline-generated and downloadable files excluded from Git
# ==========================================================================
#
# Strategy: exclude all generated/downloadable data but keep READMEs
# and the 03_external directory (expert-provided, not reproducible).
#
# Git cannot re-include files inside an ignored directory, so we
# ignore all *contents* of each subdirectory rather than the
# directory itself, then negate the READMEs.
 
# --- 01_raw: provisioned by Module 00 (downloadable from public URLs) ---
01_data/01_raw/**
!01_data/01_raw/README.md
!01_data/01_raw/_hashes_active.csv
 
# --- 02_processed: generated by pipeline execution (Modules 01-06) ---
01_data/02_processed/**
!01_data/02_processed/README.md
 
# --- 03_external: NOT excluded (committed to Git in its entirety) ---
# Contains incap_finut_master.xlsx (source of truth), the two Parquet
# tables built from it by Script 00_03, and the README.
# These files cannot be reproduced from public URLs.
 
# ==========================================================================
# Credentials & secrets — NEVER commit
# ==========================================================================
# Environment files with API tokens, passwords, and other secrets
.Renviron
.Renviron.*
!.Renviron.example
!.Renviron.template
 
# Generic secret files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets.yml
secrets.yaml
credentials.json
 
# SSH keys and certificates occasionally dropped into repos by mistake
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_ed25519
.positai
